cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "hls4tenet: Tensor Network HLS generation for FPGAs (TENET)"
abstract: >-
  TENET generates High-Level Synthesis (HLS) C++ for tensor-network machine-learning
  models, Matrix Product States (MPS) and Tree Tensor Networks (TTN), and drives
  AMD Vitis HLS C-simulation, synthesis and IP packaging from a single command.
authors:
  - given-names: Prateek
    family-names: Gupta
repository-code: "https://github.com/kalarimonk/hls4tenet"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - tensor networks
  - FPGA
  - high-level synthesis
  - Vitis HLS
  - high energy physics
  - machine learning
